==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɔɪ|lang=en}}

===Etymology 1===
Possibly from a shortened form of {{m|en|employ}} or {{m|en|deploy}}. Or from earlier {{m|en|ploye}}, from {{inh|en|enm|-}}, borrowed from {{bor|en|frm|ployer}} (compare modern {{m|fr|plier}}), from {{der|en|la|plicāre}}.

